;pylm
; Font styles:
;    0: TDecorate(count=884, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    1: TDecorate(count=2, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=なこうど, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    2: TDecorate(count=14, unk2=16755455, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    3: TDecorate(count=8, unk2=16755370, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
; Display conditions:
;    0: TWdCondition(count=1019, target=)
; Links:
;    0: TWdLink(count=908, event=, unk3=)
;---------------------------------------
; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "リファレンス専用\風姿花伝.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>―My face covered by the bridal hood, I walked with sliding steps.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\町娘背景\結婚式.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
A great many people were watching me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I could not tell how many people there were, but I could tell there were many.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Father being Father, he had surely invited a great many guests.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Among them, surely, were people connected to my husband.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
How do I look to them now?<PG>
With my face hidden and my head bowed as I walked, I could see only my feet, but perhaps from the tension of being watched by so many, my back straightened on its own.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
With my head bowed and my back straight, I surely looked as if I had a terrible stoop.<PG>
Before long, the seat where I would sit and the <STYLE ID="1" RUBY="なこうど">go-betweens</STYLE> came into view.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At this shrine, it seemed, the go-betweens entered first, then the bride, and last of all the groom.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Come to think of it, I had never even met the go-betweens.<PG>
I glanced sideways at the faces of the two go-betweens, but... 
{PAUSE ""}
neither was anyone I knew.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Were they people from a marriage business Father had hired?<PG>
{PLAYSND "SE\swish.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
Keeping my face lowered, I took my seat.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There was no one in the seat beside me yet.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Next, my husband would enter and sit in this seat.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But I had been told to keep my head bowed like this, so I did not know whether I would be able to see my husband's face from here.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Just then,<PG>
{PLAYSND "環境音\eventhall1.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "900" "3000" "PASS"}
the guests began to murmur about something.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If they were murmuring at my husband's entrance―
{PAUSE ""}
did he look that startling?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When I strained my ears...<PG>
"What's with that getup..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Creepy..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"<STYLE ID="2">Kikyo-chan</STYLE>'s marrying that?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Remarks like these, which could hardly be called kind.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I clenched my fists tight.<PG>
Whatever sort of person he may be, I will become his wife.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I will support him and spend my life with him.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I am already resolved to that.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
His looks do not matter.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It all depends on my own heart.<PG>
The man who had to be my husband sat down beside me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A little of his clothing came into my view.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I had been sure he would appear in a black hakama, but―<PG>
{STOPSND "SE" "3000" "PASS"}
What my eyes saw was a dark red cloth.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was very strange clothing.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No wonder the guests had been murmuring.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But these clothes, I had seen them somewhere―<PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
―!?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No, that can't be...!<PG>
Just then, the go-betweens told me to lift my head.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Ordinarily I would have faced straight ahead and shown my face to the guests, but I looked at him from the corner of my eye.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\能面横顔右.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Ko-sama</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">...!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I shouted under my breath.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\死神\死神手ぶらバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"K-</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kikyo-dono</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
My husband shouted under his breath too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And then the go-betweens warned us to be quiet.
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
;---------------------------------------
; END DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------